flowchart TD
    User[User or client] --> NGINX[NGINX HTTPS edge]
    NGINX --> HAProxy[HAProxy]
    HAProxy --> Backends[Backend services A, B, C]
    Backends --> Monitoring[Prometheus metrics and direct probes]
    HAProxy --> Monitoring
    Monitoring --> Rules[Deterministic rule engine]
    Rules --> Worker[Single control worker]
    Worker --> Runtime[HAProxy Runtime action]
    Runtime --> Recovered[Recovered route membership]
